Cell[TextData[{
 "Code for computing phase shifts and Sommerfeld factors for a Yukawa \
potential. \nSee [...] for technical details and notational choices.\n\nThe \
main function is ",
 StyleBox["VPSSolve[\[Zeta], \[Xi], l, sign]", "Code"],
 "which can be found in\n\t\[LongRightArrow] Code \[LongRightArrow] Variable \
phase shift set-up\[LongRightArrow] Module for solving variable phase shift \
ODEs\n\nFor physical parameters, one can use the wrapper ",
 StyleBox["PhysVPSSolve[mDM,mmed,vrel,\[Alpha],l]", "Code"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.95724980216707*^9, 3.957249802998601*^9}, {
