Cell["\<\
The Coulomb Sommerfeld factor for later comparison of the \[Xi] \
\[LongRightArrow] \[Infinity] limit.
See the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Example evaluations\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
chapter for an example.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.95724980216707*^9, 3.957249802998601*^9}, {
   3.957249851205552*^9, 3.9572499276515427`*^9}, {3.957411993198291*^9, 
